# Only the relay is built with Docker (crates/kaku-relay/Dockerfile, from
# the repository root). Send it just what it needs, never target/ or dist/.
*
!crates/kaku-relay/Cargo.toml
!crates/kaku-relay/Cargo.lock
!crates/kaku-relay/src
!crates/kaku-remote/assets/web
!assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf
!assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Medium.ttf
